ow  discover and create a personal  meaningfulness out of the absurdity and  chaos that endures the fact that life  can never be such a thing the acceptance  and realization of one's self and the  creation of personal meaning is  unfathomably difficult to process and  understand let alone do it is perhaps  the true challenge of modern human  existence however it is perhaps the only  worthy possible one an arduous process  one must work and fight for into the  lights go out we are all incredibly  strange scared and some amount dissolute  even the kindest and most charismatic  person in the world at a close enough  distance and from a far enough distance  none of us matter at all and so however  cliche it may be we really are all in  this thing together whatever it is we  all need each other's words and music  and art and ideas and hands of effort  and eyes of honesty to help us through  it not because life is some perfect  happy  easy winnable thing not because anyone  knows what they're doing or what's going  on but because it isn't and because we  don't we are perhaps the only stop on  this evolutionary train that is outside  the tunnel of Darkness able to take the  material of everything and make it into  something beautiful or helpful or  interesting to understand and create  what meaning can even mean and to do so  just because we can because the universe  for some reason gave us a blank page to  write on thanks so much for watching if  you're interested in helping further  support pursuit of Wonder and have the  means you can do so over on the pursuit  of wonder patreon page any and all  contributions help sustain the channel  its quality of resources and ability to  grow and for that if you do choose to  become a supporter it is wholeheartedly  appreciated as a thank you any  contribution three dollars or more comes  with exclusive pursuit of wonder  offerings all video content will remain  free for all viewers here on YouTube so  not to worry if you do not or